1
00:00:00,199 --> 00:00:05,178
Down the Rabbit hole Alice was beginning to get very tired of

2
00:00:05,179 --> 00:00:09,979
sitting by her sister on the bank, and of having nothing to do: once or twice she

3
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:15,438
had peeped into the book her sister was reading, but it had no pictures or conversations

4
00:00:15,439 --> 00:00:23,057
in it, “and what is the use of a book,” thought Alice “without pictures or conversations?”

5
00:00:23,058 --> 00:00:27,319
So she was considering in her own mind (as well as she could, for the hot day

6
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:32,419
made her feel very sleepy and stupid), whether the pleasure of making a daisy

7
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:37,038
chain would be worth the trouble of getting up and picking the daisies, when

8
