suddenly a White Rabbit with pink eyes ran close by her.

9
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:47,238
There was nothing so very remarkable in that; nor did Alice think it's so very

10
00:00:47,239 --> 00:00:49,339
much out of the way to hear the Rabbit

11
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:55,399
say to itself, “Oh dear! Oh dear! I shall be late!” (when she thought it over afterwards,

12
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:00,499
it occurred to her that she ought to have wondered at this, but at the time it

13
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:05,238
all seemed quite natural); but when the Rabbit actually took a

14
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:10,578
watch out of its waistcoat pocket and looked at it, and then hurried on,

15
00:01:10,579 --> 00:01:15,258
Alice started to her feet, for it flashed across her mind that she

16
